  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Investigating Timeout Causes**\n\nI\'ve zeroed in on the `r3-desktop.png` screenshot timeout. It seems to have stalled immediately after fonts loaded. My hunch? The introduction of `drawHaloText` is the culprit. Specifically, the `ctx.strokeText` calls within it, especially the `lineWidth = 3.5` setting, which are being executed on every single frame. I\'m exploring if this is the core issue.\n\n\n**Optimizing Canvas Performance**\n\nI\'m now focusing on `WaveCanvas.tsx` for performance gains. The continuous 60Hz redraw, especially with those intensive `strokeText` calls, is a CPU hog, especially on a headless system. My current strategy involves throttling the `requestAnimationFrame` to ~30fps when animating and skipping redraws when paused. Also, I\'m increasing `stepPx` in `drawWavefrontBeam` to cut canvas stroke calls nearly in half. This should significantly speed up the canvas for users and resolve the screenshot delays.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "DtQGa-_8Hffl694PmP-7kQU"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_10354907249932525087"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Optimize WaveCanvas 2D animation loop to skip redundant paused frames and throttle cleanly to ~30fps with lighter wavefront stroke sampling\",\"Instruction\":\"Increase wavefront stepPx from 3 to 5 and only redraw in requestAnimationFrame when playing and >= 30ms elapsed\",\"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":230,\"ReplacementContent\":\"      // Draw crisp sinusoidal wavefront crests & troughs\\n      const stepPx = 5;\\n      for (let s = 0; s <= length; s += stepPx) {\",\"StartLine\":218,\"TargetContent\":\"      // Draw crisp sinusoidal wavefront crests & troughs\\n      const stepPx = 3;\\n      for (let s = 0; s <= length; s += stepPx) {\"},{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":875,\"ReplacementContent\":\"    let rafId = 0;\\n    let lastTs = performance.now();\\n    let lastDrawTs = 0;\\n\\n    const tick = (now: number) => {\\n      const dt = Math.min(0.06, (now - lastTs) / 1000);\\n      lastTs = now;\\n      if (isPlayingRef.current && !prefersReducedMotion && now - lastDrawTs >= 32) {\\n        phaseRef.current = (phaseRef.current + dt * 4.2 * speedRef.current) % (Math.PI * 200);\\n        lastDrawTs = now;\\n        drawFrame();\\n      }\\n      rafId = requestAnimationFrame(tick);\\n    };\",\"StartLine\":852,\"TargetContent\":\"    let rafId = 0;\\n    let lastTs = performance.now();\\n\\n    const tick = (now: number) => {\\n      const dt = Math.min(0.05, (now - lastTs) / 1000);\\n      lastTs = now;\\n      if (isPlayingRef.current && !prefersReducedMotion) {\\n        phaseRef.current = (phaseRef.current + dt * 4.2 * speedRef.current) % (Math.PI * 200);\\n      }\\n      drawFrame();\\n      rafId = requestAnimationFrame(tick);\\n    };\"}],\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/WaveCanvas.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Optimizing WaveCanvas render cadence\",\"toolSummary\":\"Optimize WaveCanvas loop\"}"
