  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Design & Motion**\n\nI\'m focusing now on the user\'s implicit needs, particularly around frontend design and incorporating motion. It appears the project already uses Framer Motion, which simplifies things. I\'m carefully reviewing the requirements to guide my analysis.\n\n\n**Designing Animated Sliders**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on animated slider design, specifically for the `ControlDeck`. My goal is to create tactile and responsive sliders using Framer Motion, ensuring they are accessible and visually appealing while also integrating smoothly with the existing `<input type=\"range\">`. I\'ll focus on smooth animations for refractive index and incident angle, maintaining the native feel.\n\n\n**Crafting Custom Sliders**\n\nI\'m developing the `AnimatedLabSlider` component. It\'s built around a native range input, overlaid with a custom visual track. I\'m focusing on smooth, spring-animated progress fills and thumb knobs. A floating value callout badge, using `AnimatePresence`, will display values only on drag or focus, ensuring a clean UI otherwise. I\'m also considering optional calibrated markers.\n\n\n**Implementing Visual Feedback**\n\nI\'m now focusing on adding visual feedback to the sliders. I\'ll include subtle tick markers on the angle slider for Brewster\'s and critical angles, smoothly animated with refractive index changes. For the wavelength slider, I\'m integrating calibrated accent tints that match the wave color. I\'ll also implement a subtle spring pulse on the numeric readouts when users jump to presets, with full `prefers-reduced-motion` support. I\'ll review `ControlDeck.tsx` and `index.css` to check the changes.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "X9kGa4vaN_e6vdIPs_vw0Qs"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3583469434643977556"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { AnimatePresence, motion, useReducedMotion } from \'motion/react\';\\nimport { clamp } from \'../physics/emPhysics\';\\n\\nexport interface SliderMarker {\\n  value: number;\\n  label: string;\\n  colorClass: string;\\n}\\n\\ninterface AnimatedLabSliderProps {\\n  id?: string;\\n  ariaLabel: string;\\n  min: number;\\n  max: number;\\n  step: number;\\n  value: number;\\n  onChange: (value: number) => void;\\n  formatTooltip?: (value: number) => string;\\n  accentColor?: string;\\n  markers?: SliderMarker[];\\n}\\n\\nexport function computeSliderPercent(value: number, min: number, max: number): number {\\n  if (max <= min) return 0;\\n  return clamp(((value - min) / (max - min)) * 100, 0, 100);\\n}\\n\\nexport const AnimatedLabSlider: React.FC<AnimatedLabSliderProps> = ({\\n  id,\\n  ariaLabel,\\n  min,\\n  max,\\n  step,\\n  value,\\n  onChange,\\n  formatTooltip,\\n  accentColor = \'#0284c7\',\\n  markers = [],\\n}) => {\\n  const [isActive, setIsActive] = useState(false);\\n  const [isHovered, setIsHovered] = useState(false);\\n  const [isFocused, setIsFocused] = useState(false);\\n  const prefersReducedMotion = useReducedMotion();\\n\\n  const percent = computeSliderPercent(value, min, max);\\n  const showFloatingReadout = (isActive || isFocused) && Boolean(formatTooltip);\\n\\n  const springTransition = prefersReducedMotion\\n    ? { duration: 0.01 }\\n    : { type: \'spring\' as const, stiffness: 460, damping: 36, mass: 0.45 };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      className=\\\"relative flex items-center h-6 select-none\\\"\\n      onPointerEnter={() => setIsHovered(true)}\\n      onPointerLeave={() => setIsHovered(false)}\\n      data-dragging={isActive ? \'true\' : \'false\'}\\n    >\\n      {/* Visual Track */}\\n      <div className=\\\"relative w-full h-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-200 overflow-visible\\\">\\n        {/* Smooth Spring Active Fill (compositor scaleX) */}\\n        <motion.div\\n          className=\\\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-full rounded-full origin-left pointer-events-none\\\"\\n          style={{ backgroundColor: accentColor }}\\n          initial={false}\\n          animate={{ scaleX: percent / 100 }}\\n          transition={springTransition}\\n        />\\n\\n        {/* Calibrated Physical Reference Markers (e.g., \316\270B, \316\270c) */}\\n        {markers.map((m) => {\\n          const markerPct = computeSliderPercent(m.value, min, max);\\n          return (\\n            <motion.span\\n              key={m.label}\\n              aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n              title={`${m.label}: ${m.value.toFixed(1)}\302\260`}\\n              className={`absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1.5 h-3 rounded-xs pointer-events-none ${m.colorClass}`}\\n              initial={false}\\n              animate={{ left: `${markerPct}%` }}\\n              transition={springTransition}\\n            />\\n          );\\n        })}\\n\\n        {/* Spring-Animated Precision Thumb & Halo */}\\n        <motion.div\\n          aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n          className=\\\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 pointer-events-none flex items-center justify-center\\\"\\n          initial={false}\\n          animate={{ left: `${percent}%` }}\\n          transition={springTransition}\\n        >\\n          {/* Floating Live Value Readout on Drag / Keyboard Focus */}\\n          <AnimatePresence>\\n            {showFloatingReadout && formatTooltip && (\\n              <motion.div\\n                key=\\\"slider-tooltip\\\"\\n                initial={prefersReducedMotion ? { opacity: 1 } : { opacity: 0, y: 4, scale: 0.92 }}\\n                animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0, scale: 1 }}\\n                exit={prefersReducedMotion ? { opacity: 0 } : { opacity: 0, y: 3, scale: 0.94 }}\\n                transition={{ duration: 0.14, ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] }}\\n                className=\\\"absolute -top-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-white font-mono text-[11px] font-medium tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap shadow-xs\\\"\\n              >\\n                {formatTooltip(value)}\\n              </motion.div>\\n            )}\\n          </AnimatePresence>\\n\\n          {/* Subtle Tactile Ring on Hover / Drag / Focus */}\\n          <motion.span\\n            className=\\\"absolute w-7 h-7 rounded-full\\\"\\n            style={{ backgroundColor: accentColor }}\\n            initial={false}\\n            animate={{\\n              scale: isActive ? 1.1 : isFocused ? 1.0 : isHovered ? 0.85 : 0.4,\\n              opacity: isActive ? 0.2 : isFocused ? 0.18 : isHovered ? 0.12 : 0,\\n            }}\\n            transition={{ duration: 0.16, ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] }}\\n          />\\n\\n          {/* Core Thumb Knob */}\\n          <motion.span\\n            className=\\\"relative w-4 h-4 rounded-full border-2 border-white shadow-sm\\\"\\n            style={{ backgroundColor: accentColor }}\\n            initial={false}\\n            animate={{\\n              scale: isActive ? 1.2 : isHovered || isFocused ? 1.1 : 1,\\n            }}\\n            transition={{ duration: 0.15, ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] }}\\n          />\\n        </motion.div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Native Accessible Range Input overlaid for keyboard, touch, mouse & screen readers */}\\n      <input\\n        id={id}\\n        aria-label={ariaLabel}\\n        type=\\\"range\\\"\\n        min={min}\\n        max={max}\\n        step={step}\\n        value={value}\\n        onChange={(e) => onChange(Number(e.target.value))}\\n        onPointerDown={() => setIsActive(true)}\\n        onPointerUp={() => setIsActive(false)}\\n        onPointerCancel={() => setIsActive(false)}\\n        onBlur={() => {\\n          setIsActive(false);\\n          setIsFocused(false);\\n        }}\\n        onFocus={() => setIsFocused(true)}\\n        className=\\\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-0 cursor-pointer m-0\\\"\\n      />\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create AnimatedLabSlider component using motion/react spring animations, calibrated physical markers, and native range input accessibility\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/AnimatedLabSlider.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating AnimatedLabSlider component\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create AnimatedLabSlider component\"}"
