  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Envisioning Protractor Overlay**\n\nI\'m excited about the possibilities for `WaveCanvas.tsx`. The core idea is to add a calibrated optical protractor overlay, enabled by default, with a low opacity for a subtle but precise visual aid. The `protractor: true` setting is key, visualizing a protractor ring around the center `(cx, cy)`. I\'m picturing this as a crisp, unobtrusive addition to the user interface.\n\n\n**Adding New UI Controls**\n\nI\'ve been focusing on enhancing the user interface. I\'m adding a \"Th\306\260\341\273\233c \304\221o g\303\263c\" toggle button, featuring a compass icon, directly to the visual toolbar. I\'m also including zoom controls (`1.0x`, `1.35x`, `1.75x`) for zooming right into the interface. I\'m designing a new Auto Angle Sweep tool with a \"Repeat\" icon, and a visual layer bar with icon-coded toggle buttons.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "n9oGa-juL8SAkdUP5pPR4A4"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7027894899772052656"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Add visual optical protractor overlay, zoom controls, auto angle sweep tool, icon-coded layer toolbar, and live animated energy flux + wavelength comparison strip to WaveCanvas.tsx\",\"Instruction\":\"Add protractor layer, zoomLevel, isSweeping angle auto-sweep, visual toolbar icons, and animated energy/wavelength instrument strip below canvas\",\"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":20,\"ReplacementContent\":\"import React, { useEffect, useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  Activity,\\n  Compass,\\n  MoveUpRight,\\n  Pause,\\n  Play,\\n  Repeat,\\n  RotateCcw,\\n  StepForward,\\n  Waves,\\n  ZoomIn,\\n  ZoomOut,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { motion, useReducedMotion } from \'motion/react\';\\nimport {\\n  clamp,\\n  degToRad,\\n  formatWavelength,\\n  radToDeg,\\n  WavePhysicsResult,\\n  wavelengthToColor,\\n} from \'../physics/emPhysics\';\\nimport { PolarizationMode } from \'../physics/materials\';\\n\\nexport interface WaveLayerToggles {\\n  wavefronts: boolean;\\n  rays: boolean;\\n  eField: boolean;\\n  angles: boolean;\\n  protractor: boolean;\\n}\",\"StartLine\":1,\"TargetContent\":\"import React, { useEffect, useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { Pause, Play, RotateCcw, StepForward } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport {\\n  clamp,\\n  degToRad,\\n  formatWavelength,\\n  radToDeg,\\n  WavePhysicsResult,\\n  wavelengthToColor,\\n} from \'../physics/emPhysics\';\\nimport { PolarizationMode } from \'../physics/materials\';\\n\\nexport interface WaveLayerToggles {\\n  wavefronts: boolean;\\n  rays: boolean;\\n  eField: boolean;\\n  angles: boolean;\\n}\"},{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":101,\"ReplacementContent\":\"  const [isPlaying, setIsPlaying] = useState(true);\\n  const [isSweeping, setIsSweeping] = useState(false);\\n  const [speedMultiplier, setSpeedMultiplier] = useState(1.0);\\n  const [zoomLevel, setZoomLevel] = useState<number>(1.0);\\n  const [layers, setLayers] = useState<WaveLayerToggles>({\\n    wavefronts: true,\\n    rays: true,\\n    eField: true,\\n    angles: true,\\n    protractor: true,\\n  });\\n  const [dragMode, setDragMode] = useState<CanvasDragMode>(\'NONE\');\\n  const [probe, setProbe] = useState<ProbeState>({\\n    active: false,\\n    xPx: 0,\\n    yPx: 0,\\n    medium: 1,\\n    normX: 0,\\n    normZ: 0,\\n    angleFromNormalDeg: 0,\\n  });\\n  const prefersReducedMotion = useReducedMotion();\\n\\n  // Mutable animation refs to avoid React re-renders at 60Hz\\n  const phaseRef = useRef(0);\\n  const isPlayingRef = useRef(isPlaying);\\n  const speedRef = useRef(speedMultiplier);\\n  const zoomRef = useRef(zoomLevel);\\n  const physicsRef = useRef(physics);\\n  const polarizationRef = useRef(polarization);\\n  const wavelengthRef = useRef(wavelengthVacuumNm);\\n  const layersRef = useRef(layers);\\n  const labelsRef = useRef({ m1: material1Label, m2: material2Label });\\n  const sweepDirRef = useRef<1 | -1>(1);\\n  const onChangeAngleRef = useRef(onChangeIncidentAngle);\\n\\n  isPlayingRef.current = isPlaying;\\n  speedRef.current = speedMultiplier;\\n  zoomRef.current = zoomLevel;\\n  physicsRef.current = physics;\\n  polarizationRef.current = polarization;\\n  wavelengthRef.current = wavelengthVacuumNm;\\n  layersRef.current = layers;\\n  labelsRef.current = { m1: material1Label, m2: material2Label };\\n  onChangeAngleRef.current = onChangeIncidentAngle;\",\"StartLine\":63,\"TargetContent\":\"  const [isPlaying, setIsPlaying] = useState(true);\\n  const [speedMultiplier, setSpeedMultiplier] = useState(1.0);\\n  const [layers, setLayers] = useState<WaveLayerToggles>({\\n    wavefronts: true,\\n    rays: true,\\n    eField: true,\\n    angles: true,\\n  });\\n  const [dragMode, setDragMode] = useState<CanvasDragMode>(\'NONE\');\\n  const [probe, setProbe] = useState<ProbeState>({\\n    active: false,\\n    xPx: 0,\\n    yPx: 0,\\n    medium: 1,\\n    normX: 0,\\n    normZ: 0,\\n    angleFromNormalDeg: 0,\\n  });\\n\\n  // Mutable animation refs to avoid React re-renders at 60Hz\\n  const phaseRef = useRef(0);\\n  const isPlayingRef = useRef(isPlaying);\\n  const speedRef = useRef(speedMultiplier);\\n  const physicsRef = useRef(physics);\\n  const polarizationRef = useRef(polarization);\\n  const wavelengthRef = useRef(wavelengthVacuumNm);\\n  const layersRef = useRef(layers);\\n  const labelsRef = useRef({ m1: material1Label, m2: material2Label });\\n\\n  isPlayingRef.current = isPlaying;\\n  speedRef.current = speedMultiplier;\\n  physicsRef.current = physics;\\n  polarizationRef.current = polarization;\\n  wavelengthRef.current = wavelengthVacuumNm;\\n  layersRef.current = layers;\\n  labelsRef.current = { m1: material1Label, m2: material2Label };\"},{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":160,\"ReplacementContent\":\"    const cx = width * 0.5;\\n    const cy = height * 0.5;\\n    const zoom = zoomRef.current;\\n    const maxRayLen = Math.min(width * 0.45, height * 0.44) * Math.min(1.2, 0.85 + zoom * 0.15);\\n\\n    // 1. Medium 1 (Top) & Medium 2 (Bottom) backgrounds shaded subtly by refractive index\\n    const m1Alpha = clamp((p.n1 - 1.0) * 0.085, 0, 0.24);\\n    const m2Alpha = clamp((p.n2 - 1.0) * 0.085, 0, 0.24);\\n\\n    ctx.fillStyle = \'#ffffff\';\\n    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, cy);\\n    ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(14, 165, 233, ${m1Alpha.toFixed(3)})`;\\n    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, cy);\\n\\n    ctx.fillStyle = \'#f8fafc\';\\n    ctx.fillRect(0, cy, width, height - cy);\\n    ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(37, 99, 235, ${(0.03 + m2Alpha).toFixed(3)})`;\\n    ctx.fillRect(0, cy, width, height - cy);\\n\\n    // Subtle scientific coordinate grid scaled by zoom\\n    ctx.strokeStyle = \'rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22)\';\\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1;\\n    const gridStep = Math.round(36 * zoom);\\n    ctx.beginPath();\\n    for (let x = cx % gridStep; x < width; x += gridStep) {\\n      ctx.moveTo(x, 0);\\n      ctx.lineTo(x, height);\\n    }\\n    for (let y = cy % gridStep; y < height; y += gridStep) {\\n      ctx.moveTo(0, y);\\n      ctx.lineTo(width, y);\\n    }\\n    ctx.stroke();\\n\\n    // Optional calibrated circular optical protractor centered on (cx, cy)\\n    if (ly.protractor) {\\n      const pRadius = Math.min(width * 0.37, height * 0.41);\\n      ctx.save();\\n      ctx.strokeStyle = \'rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.26)\';\\n      ctx.lineWidth = 1;\\n      ctx.beginPath();\\n      ctx.arc(cx, cy, pRadius, 0, Math.PI * 2);\\n      ctx.stroke();\\n\\n      ctx.beginPath();\\n      ctx.arc(cx, cy, pRadius - 10, 0, Math.PI * 2);\\n      ctx.strokeStyle = \'rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.16)\';\\n      ctx.stroke();\\n\\n      for (let deg = 0; deg < 360; deg += 5) {\\n        const rad = degToRad(deg);\\n        const isMajor = deg % 30 === 0;\\n        const isMed = deg % 15 === 0;\\n        const innerR = isMajor ? pRadius - 11 : isMed ? pRadius - 7 : pRadius - 4;\\n        ctx.strokeStyle = isMajor\\n          ? \'rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.45)\'\\n          : \'rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.24)\';\\n        ctx.lineWidth = isMajor ? 1.2 : 0.8;\\n        ctx.beginPath();\\n        ctx.moveTo(cx + Math.sin(rad) * innerR, cy - Math.cos(rad) * innerR);\\n        ctx.lineTo(cx + Math.sin(rad) * pRadius, cy - Math.cos(rad) * pRadius);\\n        ctx.stroke();\\n      }\\n\\n      // Degree numerals relative to Normal (0\302\260 at top/bottom, 30\302\260, 60\302\260)\\n      if (width >= 480) {\\n        ctx.font = \'500 9.5px \\\"IBM Plex Mono\\\", monospace\';\\n        ctx.fillStyle = \'rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.65)\';\\n        ctx.textAlign = \'center\';\\n        ctx.textBaseline = \'middle\';\\n        const labelR = pRadius + 12;\\n        [30, 60].forEach((ang) => {\\n          const rad = degToRad(ang);\\n          // Upper-left & upper-right\\n          ctx.fillText(`${ang}\302\260`, cx - Math.sin(rad) * labelR, cy - Math.cos(rad) * labelR);\\n          ctx.fillText(`${ang}\302\260`, cx + Math.sin(rad) * labelR, cy - Math.cos(rad) * labelR);\\n          // Lower-left & lower-right\\n          ctx.fillText(`${ang}\302\260`, cx - Math.sin(rad) * labelR, cy + Math.cos(rad) * labelR);\\n          ctx.fillText(`${ang}\302\260`, cx + Math.sin(rad) * labelR, cy + Math.cos(rad) * labelR);\\n        });\\n      }\\n      ctx.restore();\\n    }\\n\\n    // Base visual wavelength in pixels scaled cleanly by refractive index & zoom\\n    const baseLambdaPx = 46 * zoom;\\n    const lambda1Px = clamp(baseLambdaPx / p.n1, 12, 86);\\n    const lambda2Px = clamp(baseLambdaPx / p.n2, 10, 86);\",\"StartLine\":120,\"TargetContent\":\"    const cx = width * 0.5;\\n    const cy = height * 0.5;\\n    const maxRayLen = Math.min(width * 0.46, height * 0.45);\\n\\n    // 1. Medium 1 (Top) & Medium 2 (Bottom) backgrounds shaded subtly by refractive index\\n    const m1Alpha = clamp((p.n1 - 1.0) * 0.085, 0, 0.24);\\n    const m2Alpha = clamp((p.n2 - 1.0) * 0.085, 0, 0.24);\\n\\n    ctx.fillStyle = \'#ffffff\';\\n    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, cy);\\n    ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(14, 165, 233, ${m1Alpha.toFixed(3)})`;\\n    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, cy);\\n\\n    ctx.fillStyle = \'#f8fafc\';\\n    ctx.fillRect(0, cy, width, height - cy);\\n    ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(37, 99, 235, ${(0.03 + m2Alpha).toFixed(3)})`;\\n    ctx.fillRect(0, cy, width, height - cy);\\n\\n    // Subtle scientific coordinate grid\\n    ctx.strokeStyle = \'rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22)\';\\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1;\\n    const gridStep = 36;\\n    ctx.beginPath();\\n    for (let x = cx % gridStep; x < width; x += gridStep) {\\n      ctx.moveTo(x, 0);\\n      ctx.lineTo(x, height);\\n    }\\n    for (let y = cy % gridStep; y < height; y += gridStep) {\\n      ctx.moveTo(0, y);\\n      ctx.lineTo(width, y);\\n    }\\n    ctx.stroke();\\n\\n    // Base visual wavelength in pixels scaled cleanly by refractive index (lambda_m = lambda_0_px / n)\\n    const baseLambdaPx = 46;\\n    const lambda1Px = clamp(baseLambdaPx / p.n1, 14, 52);\\n    const lambda2Px = clamp(baseLambdaPx / p.n2, 12, 52);\"},{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":945,\"ReplacementContent\":\"  // Re-draw immediately on prop changes when paused\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    drawFrame();\\n  }, [physics, polarization, wavelengthVacuumNm, material1Label, material2Label, layers, zoomLevel]);\\n\\n  // Smooth automated incident angle sweep mode\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!isSweeping) return;\\n    const id = window.setInterval(() => {\\n      const current = physicsRef.current.incidentAngleDeg;\\n      let next = current + sweepDirRef.current * 0.8;\\n      if (next >= 85) {\\n        next = 85;\\n        sweepDirRef.current = -1;\\n      } else if (next <= 5) {\\n        next = 5;\\n        sweepDirRef.current = 1;\\n      }\\n      onChangeAngleRef.current(Math.round(next * 10) / 10);\\n    }, 55);\\n    return () => window.clearInterval(id);\\n  }, [isSweeping]);\",\"StartLine\":937,\"TargetContent\":\"  // Re-draw immediately on prop changes when paused\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    drawFrame();\\n  }, [physics, polarization, wavelengthVacuumNm, material1Label, material2Label, layers]);\"},{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":1002,\"ReplacementContent\":\"  const handlePointerDown = (e: React.PointerEvent<HTMLCanvasElement>) => {\\n    if (isSweeping) setIsSweeping(false);\\n    const canvas = canvasRef.current;\\n    if (!canvas) return;\\n    const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\\n    const x = e.clientX - rect.left;\\n    const y = e.clientY - rect.top;\\n    const cy = rect.height * 0.5;\\n\\n    // Hit-test right-edge refractive index drag rails first\\n    if (x >= rect.width - 76) {\\n      const targetMode: CanvasDragMode = y < cy ? \'N1\' : \'N2\';\\n      setDragMode(targetMode);\\n      e.currentTarget.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\\n      updateNFromRail(e.clientY, y < cy ? 1 : 2);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    // Otherwise drag anywhere in Medium 1 to aim the incident wave\\n    if (y <= cy + 8) {\\n      setDragMode(\'ANGLE\');\\n      e.currentTarget.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\\n      updateAngleFromPointer(e.clientX, e.clientY);\\n    }\\n  };\",\"StartLine\":976,\"TargetContent\":\"  const handlePointerDown = (e: React.PointerEvent<HTMLCanvasElement>) => {\\n    const canvas = canvasRef.current;\\n    if (!canvas) return;\\n    const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\\n    const x = e.clientX - rect.left;\\n    const y = e.clientY - rect.top;\\n    const cy = rect.height * 0.5;\\n\\n    // Hit-test right-edge refractive index drag rails first\\n    if (x >= rect.width - 76) {\\n      const targetMode: CanvasDragMode = y < cy ? \'N1\' : \'N2\';\\n      setDragMode(targetMode);\\n      e.currentTarget.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\\n      updateNFromRail(e.clientY, y < cy ? 1 : 2);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    // Otherwise drag anywhere in Medium 1 to aim the incident wave\\n    if (y <= cy + 8) {\\n      setDragMode(\'ANGLE\');\\n      e.currentTarget.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\\n      updateAngleFromPointer(e.clientX, e.clientY);\\n    }\\n  };\"},{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":1179,\"ReplacementContent\":\"  const handleZoomStep = (delta: number) => {\\n    setZoomLevel((prev) => clamp(Math.round((prev + delta) * 100) / 100, 0.75, 1.75));\\n  };\\n\\n  // Build miniature wavelength comparison sine SVG paths for the visual instrument strip\\n  const waveColor = wavelengthToColor(wavelengthVacuumNm);\\n  const miniPath1 = buildMiniSinePath(112, 20, clamp(28 / physics.n1, 7, 36));\\n  const miniPath2 = buildMiniSinePath(112, 20, clamp(28 / physics.n2, 7, 36));\\n  const refPct = clamp(physics.reflectanceEffective * 100, 0, 100);\\n  const transPct = clamp(physics.transmittanceEffective * 100, 0, 100);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section\\n      aria-label=\\\"S\303\242n kh\341\272\245u m\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng truy\341\273\201n s\303\263ng \304\221i\341\273\207n t\341\273\253\\\"\\n      className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\"\\n    >\\n      {/* Visual Instrument Toolbar Row 1: Playback, Auto-Sweep, Zoom & Speed */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2.5 px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => setIsPlaying((v) => !v)}\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            {isPlaying ? <Pause className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" /> : <Play className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />}\\n            {isPlaying ? \'T\341\272\241m d\341\273\253ng\' : \'Ph\303\241t s\303\263ng\'}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={handleStepFrame}\\n            aria-label=\\\"B\306\260\341\273\233c khung s\303\263ng k\341\272\277 ti\341\272\277p\\\"\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            <StepForward className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            B\306\260\341\273\233c pha\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            aria-pressed={isSweeping}\\n            onClick={() => setIsSweeping((v) => !v)}\\n            className={`inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md border transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n              isSweeping\\n                ? \'bg-sky-700 border-sky-700 text-white\'\\n                : \'bg-white border-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            <Repeat className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            {isSweeping ? \'D\341\273\253ng qu\303\251t\' : \'Qu\303\251t g\303\263c\'}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => {\\n              setIsSweeping(false);\\n              setZoomLevel(1.0);\\n              onResetSimulation();\\n            }}\\n            aria-label=\\\"\304\220\341\272\267t l\341\272\241i tham s\341\273\221 m\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng\\\"\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            <RotateCcw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            \304\220\341\272\267t l\341\272\241i\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Right Group: Zoom Lens & Wave Speed */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          <div\\n            role=\\\"group\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Thu ph\303\263ng khung m\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng\\\"\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md overflow-hidden\\\"\\n          >\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => handleZoomStep(-0.25)}\\n              disabled={zoomLevel <= 0.75}\\n              aria-label=\\\"Thu nh\341\273\217 s\306\241 \304\221\341\273\223 s\303\263ng\\\"\\n              className=\\\"px-2 py-1.5 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 disabled:opacity-35 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ZoomOut className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n            <span className=\\\"px-2 text-[11px] font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-700 border-x border-slate-200\\\">\\n              {Math.round(zoomLevel * 100)}%\\n            </span>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => handleZoomStep(0.25)}\\n              disabled={zoomLevel >= 1.75}\\n              aria-label=\\\"Ph\303\263ng \304\221\341\272\241i s\306\241 \304\221\341\273\223 s\303\263ng\\\"\\n              className=\\\"px-2 py-1.5 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 disabled:opacity-35 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ZoomIn className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-1.5 pl-2 border-l border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-600\\\">\\n            <label htmlFor=\\\"wave-speed-select\\\" className=\\\"whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n              T\341\273\221c \304\221\341\273\231:\\n            </label>\\n            <select\\n              id=\\\"wave-speed-select\\\"\\n              value={speedMultiplier}\\n              onChange={(e) => setSpeedMultiplier(Number(e.target.value))}\\n              className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded px-1.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-slate-800\\\"\\n            >\\n              <option value={0.5}>0.5\303\227</option>\\n              <option value={1}>1.0\303\227</option>\\n              <option value={1.8}>1.8\303\227</option>\\n            </select>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Visual Instrument Toolbar Row 2: Icon-Coded Optical Layer Toggles */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 px-4 py-2 border-b border-slate-200 bg-white\\\">\\n        <div\\n          role=\\\"group\\\"\\n          aria-label=\\\"L\341\273\233p hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 m\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng\\\"\\n          className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5\\\"\\n        >\\n          {(\\n            [\\n              [\'wavefronts\', \'S\303\263ng ph\341\272\263ng\', Waves],\\n              [\'rays\', \'Tia s\303\263ng\', MoveUpRight],\\n              [\'eField\', \'Tr\306\260\341\273\235ng E\', Activity],\\n              [\'angles\', \'G\303\263c & \316\224\316\270\', Repeat],\\n              [\'protractor\', \'Th\306\260\341\273\233c \304\221o g\303\263c\', Compass],\\n            ] as const\\n          ).map(([key, label, Icon]) => (\\n            <button\\n              key={key}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              aria-pressed={layers[key]}\\n              onClick={() => toggleLayer(key)}\\n              className={`inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-md border transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n                layers[key]\\n                  ? \'bg-sky-50 border-sky-200 text-sky-900\'\\n                  : \'bg-slate-50 border-slate-200 text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              <Icon className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n              {label}\\n            </button>\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Compact Color Legend */}\\n        <div className=\\\"hidden xl:flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"w-2.5 h-0.5 inline-block\\\" style={{ backgroundColor: waveColor }} />\\n            Tia t\341\273\233i\\n          </span>\\n          <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"w-2.5 h-0.5 bg-rose-600 inline-block\\\" />\\n            Ph\341\272\243n x\341\272\241\\n          </span>\\n          <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"w-2.5 h-0.5 bg-emerald-600 inline-block\\\" />\\n            Kh\303\272c x\341\272\241\\n          </span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Main Canvas Stage */}\\n      <div\\n        ref={containerRef}\\n        className=\\\"relative w-full h-[380px] sm:h-[430px] select-none bg-white\\\"\\n        data-testid=\\\"em-wave-canvas-container\\\"\\n        data-regime={physics.classification.code}\\n      >\\n        <canvas\\n          ref={(node) => {\\n            canvasRef.current = node;\\n            if (canvasElementRef) canvasElementRef.current = node;\\n          }}\\n          data-testid=\\\"em-wave-canvas\\\"\\n          onPointerDown={handlePointerDown}\\n          onPointerMove={handlePointerMove}\\n          onPointerUp={handlePointerUp}\\n          onPointerLeave={() => {\\n            setProbe((prev) => ({ ...prev, active: false }));\\n          }}\\n          className={`w-full h-full block ${\\n            dragMode !== \'NONE\' ? \'cursor-grabbing\' : \'cursor-crosshair\'\\n          }`}\\n          aria-label=\\\"Bi\341\273\203u \304\221\341\273\223 tr\341\273\261c quan kh\303\272c x\341\272\241 v\303\240 ph\341\272\243n x\341\272\241 s\303\263ng \304\221i\341\273\207n t\341\273\253 qua m\341\272\267t ph\303\242n c\303\241ch hai m\303\264i tr\306\260\341\273\235ng\\\"\\n        />\\n\\n        {/* Subtle Bottom Coordinate Probe & Interaction Hint */}\\n        <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute bottom-2.5 left-4 right-14 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">\\n            K\303\251o ngu\341\273\223n ph\303\241t \304\221\341\273\203 ch\341\273\211nh \316\270i \302\267 K\303\251o thanh b\303\252n ph\341\272\243i \304\221\341\273\203 ch\341\273\211nh chi\341\272\277t su\341\272\245t n\342\202\201, n\342\202\202 tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p\\n          </span>\\n          {probe.active && (\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline bg-white/90 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-200 tabular-nums text-slate-700 shrink-0 ml-2\\\">\\n              MT{probe.medium} \302\267 x={probe.normX.toFixed(2)} \302\267 z={probe.normZ.toFixed(2)} \302\267 \342\210\240N=\\n              {probe.angleFromNormalDeg.toFixed(1)}\302\260\\n            </span>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Live Visual Instrument Strip: Animated Energy Flux Bar + Wavelength Compression Gauge */}\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 px-4 py-3 border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 items-center\\\">\\n        {/* Energy Split Meter */}\\n        <div className=\\\"md:col-span-7 space-y-1.5\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-rose-700 font-semibold\\\">\\n              Ph\341\272\243n x\341\272\241 R: {refPct.toFixed(1)}%\\n            </span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">Ph\303\242n b\341\273\225 n\304\203ng l\306\260\341\273\243ng s\303\263ng</span>\\n            <span\\n              className={`font-semibold ${\\n                physics.isTotalInternalReflection ? \'text-amber-700\' : \'text-emerald-700\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              {physics.isTotalInternalReflection\\n                ? \'S\303\263ng suy gi\341\272\243m (T = 0%)\'\\n                : `Truy\341\273\201n qua T: ${transPct.toFixed(1)}%`}\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div\\n            aria-label=\\\"Thanh \304\221o t\341\273\267 l\341\273\207 n\304\203ng l\306\260\341\273\243ng ph\341\272\243n x\341\272\241 v\303\240 truy\341\273\201n qua\\\"\\n            className=\\\"h-2.5 w-full rounded-full bg-slate-200 overflow-hidden flex\\\"\\n          >\\n            <motion.div\\n              className=\\\"h-full bg-rose-600 origin-left\\\"\\n              initial={false}\\n              animate={{ width: `${refPct}%` }}\\n              transition={\\n                prefersReducedMotion\\n                  ? { duration: 0.01 }\\n                  : { type: \'spring\', stiffness: 360, damping: 34 }\\n              }\\n            />\\n            <motion.div\\n              className=\\\"h-full bg-emerald-600 origin-right\\\"\\n              initial={false}\\n              animate={{ width: `${transPct}%` }}\\n              transition={\\n                prefersReducedMotion\\n                  ? { duration: 0.01 }\\n                  : { type: \'spring\', stiffness: 360, damping: 34 }\\n              }\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Live Spatial Wavelength Compression Preview */}\\n        <div className=\\\"md:col-span-5 md:border-l md:border-slate-200 md:pl-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"space-y-1 min-w-0\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500\\\">N\303\251n / gi\303\243n b\306\260\341\273\233c s\303\263ng (\316\273\342\202\201 \342\206\222 \316\273\342\202\202)</div>\\n            <div className=\\\"font-mono text-xs text-slate-800 tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n              {formatWavelength(physics.wavelength1Nm)} \342\206\222 {formatWavelength(physics.wavelength2Nm)}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n            <svg width=\\\"112\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 112 24\\\" className=\\\"overflow-visible\\\">\\n              <path\\n                d={miniPath1}\\n                fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n                stroke={waveColor}\\n                strokeWidth=\\\"1.6\\\"\\n                opacity=\\\"0.45\\\"\\n              />\\n              <path\\n                d={miniPath2}\\n                fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n                stroke={physics.isTotalInternalReflection ? \'#d97706\' : \'#059669\'}\\n                strokeWidth=\\\"1.9\\\"\\n              />\\n            </svg>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nfunction buildMiniSinePath(width: number, height: number, lambdaPx: number): string {\\n  const midY = height / 2 + 2;\\n  const amp = height * 0.36;\\n  const pts: string[] = [];\\n  for (let x = 0; x <= width; x += 2) {\\n    const y = midY - Math.sin((x / lambdaPx) * Math.PI * 2) * amp;\\n    pts.push(`${x === 0 ? \'M\' : \'L\'}${x},${y.toFixed(1)}`);\\n  }\\n  return pts.join(\' \');\\n}\",\"StartLine\":1053,\"TargetContent\":\"  return (\\n    <section\\n      aria-label=\\\"S\303\242n kh\341\272\245u m\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng truy\341\273\201n s\303\263ng \304\221i\341\273\207n t\341\273\253\\\"\\n      className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\"\\n    >\\n      {/* Compact Instrument Toolbar */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => setIsPlaying((v) => !v)}\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            {isPlaying ? <Pause className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" /> : <Play className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />}\\n            {isPlaying ? \'T\341\272\241m d\341\273\253ng\' : \'Ph\303\241t s\303\263ng\'}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={handleStepFrame}\\n            aria-label=\\\"B\306\260\341\273\233c khung s\303\263ng k\341\272\277 ti\341\272\277p\\\"\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            <StepForward className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            B\306\260\341\273\233c pha\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={onResetSimulation}\\n            aria-label=\\\"\304\220\341\272\267t l\341\272\241i tham s\341\273\221 m\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng\\\"\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            <RotateCcw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            \304\220\341\272\267t l\341\272\241i\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-1.5 pl-2 border-l border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-600\\\">\\n            <label htmlFor=\\\"wave-speed-select\\\" className=\\\"whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n              T\341\273\221c \304\221\341\273\231:\\n            </label>\\n            <select\\n              id=\\\"wave-speed-select\\\"\\n              value={speedMultiplier}\\n              onChange={(e) => setSpeedMultiplier(Number(e.target.value))}\\n              className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded px-1.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-slate-800\\\"\\n            >\\n              <option value={0.5}>0.5\303\227</option>\\n              <option value={1}>1.0\303\227</option>\\n              <option value={1.8}>1.8\303\227</option>\\n            </select>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Layer Visibility Toggles */}\\n        <div\\n          role=\\\"group\\\"\\n          aria-label=\\\"L\341\273\233p hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 m\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng\\\"\\n          className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 bg-slate-100 p-1 rounded-lg\\\"\\n        >\\n          {(\\n            [\\n              [\'wavefronts\', \'S\303\263ng ph\341\272\263ng\'],\\n              [\'rays\', \'Tia s\303\263ng\'],\\n              [\'eField\', \'Tr\306\260\341\273\235ng E\'],\\n              [\'angles\', \'G\303\263c & Ph\303\241p tuy\341\272\277n\'],\\n            ] as const\\n          ).map(([key, label]) => (\\n            <button\\n              key={key}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              aria-pressed={layers[key]}\\n              onClick={() => toggleLayer(key)}\\n              className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n                layers[key]\\n                  ? \'bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-xs\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              {label}\\n            </button>\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Main Canvas Stage */}\\n      <div\\n        ref={containerRef}\\n        className=\\\"relative w-full h-[380px] sm:h-[430px] select-none bg-white\\\"\\n        data-testid=\\\"em-wave-canvas-container\\\"\\n        data-regime={physics.classification.code}\\n      >\\n        <canvas\\n          ref={(node) => {\\n            canvasRef.current = node;\\n            if (canvasElementRef) canvasElementRef.current = node;\\n          }}\\n          data-testid=\\\"em-wave-canvas\\\"\\n          onPointerDown={handlePointerDown}\\n          onPointerMove={handlePointerMove}\\n          onPointerUp={handlePointerUp}\\n          onPointerLeave={() => {\\n            setProbe((prev) => ({ ...prev, active: false }));\\n          }}\\n          className={`w-full h-full block ${\\n            dragMode !== \'NONE\' ? \'cursor-grabbing\' : \'cursor-crosshair\'\\n          }`}\\n          aria-label=\\\"Bi\341\273\203u \304\221\341\273\223 tr\341\273\261c quan kh\303\272c x\341\272\241 v\303\240 ph\341\272\243n x\341\272\241 s\303\263ng \304\221i\341\273\207n t\341\273\253 qua m\341\272\267t ph\303\242n c\303\241ch hai m\303\264i tr\306\260\341\273\235ng\\\"\\n        />\\n\\n        {/* Subtle Bottom Coordinate Probe & Interaction Hint */}\\n        <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute bottom-2.5 left-4 right-14 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">\\n            K\303\251o ngu\341\273\223n ph\303\241t \304\221\341\273\203 ch\341\273\211nh \316\270i \302\267 K\303\251o thanh b\303\252n ph\341\272\243i \304\221\341\273\203 ch\341\273\211nh chi\341\272\277t su\341\272\245t n\342\202\201, n\342\202\202 tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p\\n          </span>\\n          {probe.active && (\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline bg-white/90 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-200 tabular-nums text-slate-700 shrink-0 ml-2\\\">\\n              MT{probe.medium} \302\267 x={probe.normX.toFixed(2)} \302\267 z={probe.normZ.toFixed(2)} \302\267 \342\210\240N=\\n              {probe.angleFromNormalDeg.toFixed(1)}\302\260\\n            </span>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\"}],\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/WaveCanvas.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Adding visual protractor, zoom, auto-sweep, and energy flux bar to WaveCanvas\",\"toolSummary\":\"Add visual instruments to WaveCanvas\"}"
