  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Optimizing Canvas Rendering**\n\nI\'ve made significant strides in optimizing `WaveCanvas.tsx`. First, I\'ve successfully batched the 72 optical protractor ticks into just 2 strokes, dramatically speeding up software canvas rendering. Second, I fixed a subtle but impactful bug where redundant points were hindering line rendering performance. The improvements are very promising so far!\n\n\n**Refining Iconography and Hints**\n\nI\'m focused on improving clarity and visual cues. I\'ve imported `Ruler` from `lucide-react` for the \'G\303\263c & \316\224\316\270\' row, ensuring \'Qu\303\251t g\303\263c\' exclusively uses the \'Repeat\' icon. I\'m also ensuring the bottom hint text doesn\'t overlap the protractor numeral, using a white backing and adjusted positioning. Additionally, I\'ve added color cues (`\316\273\342\202\201`/`\316\273\342\202\202`) to the wavelength compression gauge for immediate wave differentiation. I am ready to implement these edits.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "m-AGa5WQBuq9vdIP3I-ziQ0"
