  planner_response {
    response: "\341\273\250ng d\341\273\245ng \304\221\303\243 \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c c\341\272\255p nh\341\272\255t hi\341\273\207u \341\273\251ng ho\341\272\241t h\341\273\215a l\303\262 xo m\306\260\341\273\243t m\303\240 cho to\303\240n b\341\273\231 c\303\241c thanh tr\306\260\341\273\243t \304\221i\341\273\201u khi\341\273\203n th\303\264ng s\341\273\221 (k\303\250m nh\303\243n hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 gi\303\241 tr\341\273\213 t\341\273\251c th\341\273\235i khi k\303\251o v\303\240 v\341\272\241ch \304\221\303\241nh d\341\272\245u g\303\263c Brewster $\\theta_B$, g\303\263c t\341\273\233i h\341\272\241n $\\theta_c$ ngay tr\303\252n thanh tr\306\260\341\273\243t g\303\263c t\341\273\233i). S\303\242n kh\341\272\245u m\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng c\305\251ng \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c b\341\273\225 sung h\341\273\207 thanh c\303\264ng c\341\273\245 tr\341\273\261c quan h\306\241n g\341\273\223m th\306\260\341\273\233c \304\221o g\303\263c quang h\341\273\215c t\303\255ch h\341\273\243p, n\303\272t qu\303\251t g\303\263c t\341\273\233i t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng, c\341\273\245m thu ph\303\263ng s\306\241 \304\221\341\273\223 s\303\263ng, c\303\241c n\303\272t b\341\272\255t/t\341\272\257t l\341\273\233p hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 c\303\263 bi\341\273\203u t\306\260\341\273\243ng ri\303\252ng v\303\240 d\341\272\243i \304\221o ph\303\242n b\341\273\225 n\304\203ng l\306\260\341\273\243ng ph\341\272\243n x\341\272\241/truy\341\273\201n qua c\303\271ng \304\221\341\273\223 th\341\273\213 so s\303\241nh n\303\251n gi\303\243n b\306\260\341\273\233c s\303\263ng theo th\341\273\235i gian th\341\273\261c."
    thinking: "**Inspecting The Captures**\n\nI\'m diving deep into the three captures. I am seeing that the \"Ruler\" icon on \"G\303\263c & \316\224\316\270\" is sharp and clearly different from \"Qu\303\251t g\303\263c\" (\"Repeat\") and \"Th\306\260\341\273\233c \304\221o g\303\263c\" (\"Compass\") in the `r5-desktop.png` screenshot. I will see what else I can find in the other files.\n\n\n**Analyzing Visual Detail**\n\nI\'m impressed by the visual clarity in these captures. The frosted white hint box sits perfectly. Both the Energy Flux Bar and Wavelength Compression gauge are strikingly legible, even in the `ControlDeck` animations. The animated sliders in the `ControlDeck` render crisply, particularly the amber `\316\270B` marker\'s accurate positioning on the `G\303\263c t\341\273\233i (\316\270i)` slider. I am seeing the switch to `Ph\341\272\243n x\341\272\241 to\303\240n ph\341\272\247n` triggers smooth animations and adds calibrated markers, along with changes to the flux bar and wave visualization.\n\n\n"
