    thinking: "**Prioritizing Crucial Constraints**\n\nI\'ve hit a critical constraint \342\200\223 the \"CONSENT GATE\" rule, as outlined in `cloudsql-setup/SKILL.md`, especially lines 31-68. This is absolute. I\'m stopping all technical actions until I fully understand and comply. Installing npm packages is a strict no-go until this is resolved.\n\n\n**Verifying Initial Eligibility**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on Step 1, the eligibility check. The \"CONSENT GATE\" is holding strong; no `drizzle-orm`, no schema files, nothing. I\'m focusing on the `CheckFeatureEligibility` RPC call, ensuring the `applet_id` matches \"ab69d8c7-66a\" as the guide specifies. I\'m prioritizing this mandatory action before even considering UI elements or code. My task is strictly following the sequence!\n\n\n"
