d input angles without falling back silently  ---  duration_ms: 0.654636  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: PDF report metadata formats refracted angle, ray deviation, and TIR state accuratelyok 10 - PDF report metadata formats refracted angle, ray deviation, and TIR state accurately  ---  duration_ms: 264.72698  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: Animated slider percentage calculation normalizes and clamps bounds accuratelyok 11 - Animated slider percentage calculation normalizes and clamps bounds accurately  ---  duration_ms: 469.62057  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: 3D optical bench vectors maintain unit length and handle Snell and TIR statesok 12 - 3D optical bench vectors maintain unit length and handle Snell and TIR states  ---  duration_ms: 161.311266  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: Search grounding utilities sanitize unsafe URLs and parse refractive indices cleanlyok 13 - Search grounding utilities sanitize unsafe URLs and parse refractive indices cleanly  ---  duration_ms: 6.516751  type: \'test\'  ...1..13# tests 13# suites 0# pass 13# fail 0# cancelled 0# skipped 0# todo 0# duration_ms 1303.274273"
