  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Error**\n\nOkay, so I just got a `429 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED` error from the Gemini API. This is key because it means I\'ve exceeded my current quota. I need to investigate the plan and billing details, and what part of the API usage is causing this. It\'s a critical piece of information.\n\n\n**Refining Error Handling**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the infrastructure is correctly configured; the `429` error stems directly from the Gemini API. Following `gemini-api/SKILL.md` guidance, I need to improve error handling. Specifically, I must refine the `/api/search/material` route to return more user-friendly error messages instead of raw JSON. The current raw JSON `\"{\\\"error\\\":{\\\"code\\\":429,...}}\"` needs replacement with a clear, actionable message for the user, perhaps referencing quota limits and paid tier options.\n\n\n**Improving Error Clarity**\n\nI\'m now focusing on clarifying Gemini API error messages. Specifically, I am working to translate and make the `429 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED`, `403 PERMISSION_DENIED`, and other errors more user-friendly. The new code in `src/lib/gemini.ts` and `server.ts` provides Vietnamese messages, for example. The goal is a clean, actionable message for the user, referring them to **Settings > Secrets** where appropriate. I\'m also ensuring we never \"fabricate\" a search result. Alongside that, I am making improvements to camera framing, as well, for visual clarity.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "fhgHa5_0MIqFxN8PydXXkQk"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_15124118778185516653"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Translate upstream Gemini API 429/403/400 errors into clean, actionable Vietnamese messages without masking errors.\",\"EndLine\":176,\"Instruction\":\"Improve error handling in POST /api/search/material in server.ts.\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"    } catch (error: unknown) {\\n      console.error(\'Material search grounding failed:\', error);\\n      const rawMsg = error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error);\\n      if (rawMsg.includes(\'429\') || rawMsg.includes(\'RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED\')) {\\n        return res.status(429).json({\\n          error:\\n            \'H\341\272\241n m\341\273\251c g\341\273\215i d\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 t\303\254m ki\341\272\277m Gemini API hi\341\273\207n \304\221\303\243 h\341\272\277t (429 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED). Vui l\303\262ng ki\341\273\203m tra g\303\263i c\306\260\341\273\233c ho\341\272\267c ch\341\273\215n kh\303\263a API c\303\263 b\341\272\255t thanh to\303\241n trong Settings > Secrets.\',\\n        });\\n      }\\n      if (rawMsg.includes(\'403\') || rawMsg.includes(\'PERMISSION_DENIED\') || rawMsg.includes(\'API_KEY_INVALID\')) {\\n        return res.status(403).json({\\n          error:\\n            \'Kh\303\263a Gemini API ch\306\260a h\341\273\243p l\341\273\207 ho\341\272\267c thi\341\272\277u quy\341\273\201n truy c\341\272\255p. Vui l\303\262ng ki\341\273\203m tra c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh trong Settings > Secrets.\',\\n        });\\n      }\\n      return res.status(502).json({\\n        error: \'Kh\303\264ng th\341\273\203 ho\303\240n t\341\272\245t tra c\341\273\251u d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u Google Search l\303\272c n\303\240y. Vui l\303\262ng th\341\273\255 l\341\272\241i sau.\',\\n      });\\n    }\",\"StartLine\":166,\"TargetContent\":\"    } catch (error: unknown) {\\n      console.error(\'Material search grounding failed:\', error);\\n      const message =\\n        error instanceof Error\\n          ? error.message\\n          : \'Kh\303\264ng th\341\273\203 th\341\273\261c hi\341\273\207n tra c\341\273\251u d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u l\303\272c n\303\240y. Vui l\303\262ng th\341\273\255 l\341\272\241i.\';\\n      return res.status(502).json({ error: message });\\n    }\",\"TargetFile\":\"/server.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Improving search API error translation\",\"toolSummary\":\"Polish error handling in server.ts\"}"
