  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Executing Browser Verification**\n\nI\'m now focusing on executing a comprehensive browser verification round, encompassing both desktop (1440x900) and mobile (390x844) resolutions. I intend to use `playwright-cli` with `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT` for this. The plan is to run all journeys through a single script, starting with desktop (1440).\n\n\n**Verifying AI Prediction Flow**\n\nI\'ve just validated the AI prediction workflow. This involved clearing and submitting the textarea to confirm Vietnamese validation errors, then triggering a prediction with a preset scenario. I\'m waiting for the `POST /api/ai/predict-wave` response, which should capture either a live AI result and SVG or a quota notice. A screenshot is saved as `.playwright-cli/r9-ai-predict.png`. I\'m now transitioning to mobile testing at 390x844, starting with the navigation bar.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "KR0Ha5XrIoCtkdUPjd2koAY"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_14981414543432345425"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"trap \'playwright-cli close >/dev/null 2>&1 || true\' EXIT\\nplaywright-cli open http://localhost:3000\\nplaywright-cli resize 1440 900\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async page => {\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'header\');\\n  await page.evaluate(() => document.fonts.ready);\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(400);\\n  const fontMetrics = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const loaded = Array.from(document.fonts).filter(f => f.status === \'loaded\').map(f => f.family);\\n    const bodyStyle = getComputedStyle(document.body);\\n    const h2 = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"regime-label\\\\\\\"]\');\\n    const h2Style = h2 ? getComputedStyle(h2) : null;\\n    const navButtons = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\'header nav button\')).map(b => ({\\n      text: b.textContent?.trim(),\\n      lines: b.getClientRects().length\\n    }));\\n    return {\\n      loadedFonts: [...new Set(loaded)],\\n      bodyFont: bodyStyle.fontFamily,\\n      h2Font: h2Style?.fontFamily,\\n      h2Size: h2Style?.fontSize,\\n      overflowX: document.documentElement.scrollWidth > window.innerWidth,\\n      navButtons\\n    };\\n  });\\n  console.log(\'DESKTOP_FONT_METRICS:\', JSON.stringify(fontMetrics));\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r9-2d-typography.png\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async page => {\\n  await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: /D\341\273\261 \304\221o\303\241n h\306\260\341\273\233ng s\303\263ng AI/i }).click();\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'#ai-wave-scenario-input\');\\n  // Test empty validation first\\n  await page.fill(\'#ai-wave-scenario-input\', \'\');\\n  await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: /D\341\273\261 \304\221o\303\241n h\306\260\341\273\233ng truy\341\273\201n s\303\263ng/i }).click();\\n  const valErr = await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"ai-predict-error\\\\\\\"]\').textContent();\\n  console.log(\'AI_VALIDATION_ERROR:\', valErr);\\n  // Select first preset and submit real server call\\n  await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: /L\303\265i s\341\273\243i quang th\341\272\241ch anh/i }).click();\\n  const [resp] = await Promise.all([\\n    page.waitForResponse(r => r.url().includes(\'/api/ai/predict-wave\')),\\n    page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: /D\341\273\261 \304\221o\303\241n h\306\260\341\273\233ng truy\341\273\201n s\303\263ng/i }).click()\\n  ]);\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(500);\\n  const status = resp.status();\\n  const hasMetrics = await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"ai-prediction-metrics\\\\\\\"]\').count();\\n  const errText = await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"ai-predict-error\\\\\\\"]\').textContent().catch(() => null);\\n  console.log(\'AI_PREDICT_STATUS:\', status, \'HAS_METRICS:\', hasMetrics, \'ERR:\', errText);\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r9-ai-predict.png\\nplaywright-cli resize 390 844\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async page => {\\n  await page.getByRole(\'navigation\', { name: \'\304\220i\341\273\201u h\306\260\341\273\233ng di \304\221\341\273\231ng\' }).getByRole(\'button\', { name: \'3D\', exact: true }).click();\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"wave-scene-3d\\\\\\\"] canvas\');\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1000);\\n  const mobileMetrics = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const docOverflow = document.documentElement.scrollWidth > window.innerWidth;\\n    const dockGroup = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"wave-scene-3d\\\\\\\"] [role=\\\\\\\"group\\\\\\\"]\');\\n    const camBtns = dockGroup ? Array.from(dockGroup.querySelectorAll(\'button\')).map(b => ({\\n      text: b.textContent?.trim(),\\n      right: Math.round(b.getBoundingClientRect().right),\\n      clipped: b.getBoundingClientRect().right > window.innerWidth - 6\\n    })) : [];\\n    return { docOverflow, winW: window.innerWidth, camBtns };\\n  });\\n  console.log(\'MOBILE_3D_METRICS:\', JSON.stringify(mobileMetrics));\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli