    response: "M\303\254nh \304\221\303\243 t\303\255ch h\341\273\243p t\303\255nh n\304\203ng **AI d\341\273\261 \304\221o\303\241n h\306\260\341\273\233ng truy\341\273\201n s\303\263ng** (tab **D\341\273\261 \304\221o\303\241n AI** v\303\240 n\303\272t truy c\341\272\255p nhanh ngay trong m\341\273\245c nh\341\272\255n d\341\272\241ng c\341\273\247a **M\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng 2D**) \304\221\341\273\203 b\341\272\241n m\303\264 t\341\272\243 k\341\273\213ch b\341\272\243n th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277 ho\341\272\267c g\341\272\257n c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh ph\303\262ng lab hi\341\273\207n t\341\272\241i, nh\341\272\255n d\341\273\261 \304\221o\303\241n qu\341\273\271 \304\221\341\272\241o tia t\341\273\233i/ph\341\272\243n x\341\272\241/kh\303\272c x\341\272\241 (ho\341\272\267c ph\341\272\243n x\341\272\241 to\303\240n ph\341\272\247n), bi\341\273\203u \304\221\341\273\223 vect\306\241 minh h\341\273\215a, \304\221\341\273\221i chi\341\272\277u t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng v\341\273\233i \304\221\341\273\213nh lu\341\272\255t Snell v\303\240 n\341\272\241p tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p sang m\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng 2D/3D ch\341\273\211 v\341\273\233i m\341\273\231t l\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245n.\n\n\304\220\341\273\223ng th\341\273\235i, to\303\240n b\341\273\231 h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng ch\341\273\257 trong \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng \304\221\303\243 \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221\341\273\225i sang b\341\273\231 font t\341\273\221i \306\260u cho ti\341\272\277ng Vi\341\273\207t v\303\240 d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u khoa h\341\273\215c (**Be Vietnam Pro** cho ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201, **IBM Plex Sans** cho v\304\203n b\341\272\243n giao di\341\273\207n, **JetBrains Mono** cho s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u v\303\240 c\303\264ng th\341\273\251c) c\303\271ng t\341\273\267 l\341\273\207 k\303\255ch th\306\260\341\273\233c, \304\221\341\273\231 cao d\303\262ng v\303\240 c\304\203n ch\341\273\211nh b\341\272\243ng bi\341\273\203u c\303\242n \304\221\341\273\221i h\306\241n tr\303\252n c\341\272\243 m\303\241y t\303\255nh l\341\272\253n \304\221i\341\273\207n tho\341\272\241i.\n\nC\303\241c l\341\273\207nh g\341\273\215i AI \304\221\341\273\201u \304\221i qua m\303\241y ch\341\273\247 \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng k\303\250m ki\341\273\203m tra ch\341\272\267t tham s\341\273\221 \304\221\341\272\247u v\303\240o \304\221\341\273\203 gi\341\273\257 an to\303\240n kh\303\263a API v\303\240 \304\221\341\272\243m b\341\272\243o t\303\255nh ch\303\255nh x\303\241c c\341\273\247a d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u g\341\273\255i l\303\252n."
    thinking: "**Observing Stellar Success**\n\nI\'m incredibly excited! That first Playwright test run using Gemini 4 Hydrogen was flawless, achieving zero Snell error. The screenshot confirms everything worked perfectly on that first attempt!\n\n\n**Analyzing AI Render**\n\nI\'m now marveling at the clean Gemini AI response, rendered directly in the browser. It\'s presenting a perfect Total Internal Reflection scenario with an infrared laser. The detailed SVG vector diagram and quantitative strip are brilliant, and the physics verification is HIGH confidence and no deviation. The inclusion of one-click actions for 2D and 3D visualization is a game-changer.\n\n\n**Evaluating Total Internal Reflection**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the implications of total internal reflection, specifically the scenario with an incident angle of 48\302\260 exceeding the critical angle of approximately 43.30\302\260. Snell\'s Law won\'t work in this context! The reflection is now complete, the reflection coefficient is 1, and there\'s an evanescent wave. Plus, the typography across both screenshots is perfect, and it is a genuinely flagship scientific instrument!\n\n\n"
