  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Application**: **EMRefract Lab**, a Vietnamese electromagnetic wave refraction simulation and characteristic identification workbench (React 19, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, TypeScript, Express, Drizzle ORM + Cloud SQL PostgreSQL, Firebase Auth, Three.js, `motion`, `lucide-react`, `jspdf`, `@google/genai`).\n- **Completed Prior Work (Verified in Browser)**:\n  - Interactive 2D Canvas EM wave simulator (`WaveCanvas.tsx`), spring-animated `ControlDeck.tsx`, `CharacteristicsPanel.tsx`, `FresnelChart.tsx`, `InverseIdentifierView.tsx`, PDF export (`pdfReport.ts`), Three.js 3D optical bench (`WaveScene3D.tsx` + mobile dock fix verified), Cloud SQL PostgreSQL persistence (`MeasurementLogView.tsx`), Google Search material lookup (`MaterialSearchView.tsx`), AI wave propagation direction predictor (`AiWavePredictorView.tsx` + `POST /api/ai/predict-wave` using `gemini-4-hydrogen`), and redesigned Vietnamese scientific typography (`Be Vietnam Pro` display + `IBM Plex Sans` body + `JetBrains Mono` tabular data).\n- **Current Active User Request**:\n  > *\"Th\303\252m t\303\255nh n\304\203ng hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 bi\341\273\203u \304\221\341\273\223 so s\303\241nh chi\341\272\277t su\341\272\245t (n1, n2) hi\341\273\207n t\341\272\241i so v\341\273\233i c\303\241c v\341\272\255t li\341\273\207u ph\341\273\225 bi\341\272\277n trong th\306\260 vi\341\273\207n \304\221\341\273\203 ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng c\303\263 c\303\241i nh\303\254n t\341\273\225ng quan v\341\273\201 m\303\264i tr\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221ang m\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng.\"*\n  - **Deliverables**:\n    1. Pure comparison data & bracket-matching utility (`/src/utils/refractiveComparison.ts`).\n    2. Interactive calibrated horizontal bar comparison chart component (`/src/components/RefractiveIndexComparisonChart.tsx`) showing current `n\342\202\201` and `n\342\202\202` reference lines, shaded optical contrast span (`\316\224n`), material category filter (`T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243`, `Kh\303\255 & L\341\273\217ng`, `Quang h\341\273\215c`, `B\303\241n d\341\272\253n & RF`), hover/focus notes & `\316\265r`, custom value bracket positioning insight, and one-click material assignment to `n\342\202\201` or `n\342\202\202`.\n    3. Integration into `/src/App.tsx` inside the `M\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng 2D` workspace right below `<FresnelChart />`.\n    4. Unit tests for `src/utils/refractiveComparison.ts` added to `/src/physics/emPhysics.test.ts`.\n    5. Full build (`compile_applet`), lint (`lint_applet`), unit test pass (`npx --yes tsx --test src/physics/emPhysics.test.ts`), `restart_dev_server`, and 1 targeted browser verification round (`playwright-cli`) checking desktop + mobile views.\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed & Written (Not Yet Wired/Compiled/Tested)\n- **`/src/utils/refractiveComparison.ts`** *(Created)*:\n  - Exports `ComparisonCategoryFilter`, `ComparisonBarItem`, `MaterialBracketSummary`, `RefractiveComparisonModel`, `filterMaterialsByGroup`, `findMaterialBracket`, `normalizeRefractiveIndexToPct`, and `buildRefractiveComparisonModel`.\n  - Handles ascending sort of `OPTICAL_MATERIALS`, hides duplicate `vacuum` when `air` is shown unless `vacuum` is actively selected, dynamically expands `maxScale` above `3.5` when custom `n > 3.5` (up to `3.8`), computes exact `n1Pct`, `n2Pct`, shaded contrast span (`spanLeftPct`, `spanWidthPct`), `ratioN2ToN1`, `deltaN`, `markersAreClose` (for collision avoidance when `|n2Pct - n1Pct| < 13`), and exact/neighboring library material brackets (`n1Bracket`, `n2Bracket`).\n- **`/src/components/RefractiveIndexComparisonChart.tsx`** *(Created)*:\n  - Exports `RefractiveIndexComparisonChart`.\n  - Features `Be Vietnam Pro` heading, `IBM Plex Sans` labels, `JetBrains Mono` tabular numbers, zero-pill metadata, category segmented filter, `Nh\341\272\245p \304\221\341\273\203 g\303\241n: n\342\202\201 | n\342\202\202` target toggle, calibrated numeric scale axis (`1.0` to `maxScale`), full-height `n\342\202\201` (sky-600) and `n\342\202\202` (indigo-600) vertical reference lines with collision-staggered top pin labels (`data-testid=\"chart-marker-n1\"`, `data-testid=\"chart-marker-n2\"`), shaded `\316\224n` span (`sky-100/45` when `n\342\202\202 \342\211\245 n\342\202\201`, `amber-100/45` when `n\342\202\201 > n\342\202\202`), spring-animated horizontal bars (`data-testid=\"comparison-bar-<material.id>\"`), and unboxed bottom bracket positioning summary (`data-testid=\"comparison-bracket-summary\"`) / hover detail strip.\n\n### Not Yet Modified / Remaining\n- **`/src/App.tsx`**: Still needs import and rendering of `<RefractiveIndexComparisonChart />` directly below `<FresnelChart />` in `activeTab === \'SIMULATOR\'`, wired to `n1`, `n2`, `material1Id`, `material2Id`, `material1Label`, `material2Label`, `onSelectMaterialForN1`, and `onSelectMaterialForN2`.\n- **`/src/physics/emPhysics.test.ts`**: Still needs unit test(s) for `buildRefractiveComparisonModel`, `filterMaterialsByGroup`, and `findMaterialBracket` (testing exact matches, custom between-materials bracket e.g. `n2 = 2.05` between `flint` and `diamond`, high custom `n = 3.8` dynamic scale expansion, and category filtering).\n- **Compilation, Linting, Unit Tests, Server Restart, and Browser Verification**: Have NOT been run yet since creating the 2 new files.\n\n### Skills Already Read\n- `frontend-design` + `references/8_science_space_biotech.md`, `ultra-mode`, `gemini-api`.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **`/src/physics/materials.ts`** contains 11 `OPTICAL_MATERIALS` across 4 categories (`Kh\303\255 & Ch\303\242n kh\303\264ng`, `Ch\341\272\245t l\341\273\217ng`, `Th\341\273\247y tinh & Quang h\341\273\215c`, `B\303\241n d\341\272\253n & RF`), spanning `n = 1.000` (`vacuum`/`air`) through `n = 3.420` (`silicon`), while `ControlDeck.tsx` allows custom refractive indices up to `3.800`. Therefore `buildRefractiveComparisonModel` dynamically extends `maxScale` whenever `Math.max(n1, n2) > 3.5` so custom values never clip off the right edge.\n- **Collision Guard**: When `n\342\202\201` and `n\342\202\202` are close (e.g. `|n2Pct - n1Pct| < 13`), the top `n\342\202\201` and `n\342\202\202` pin labels stagger vertically (`top-0` vs `top-4`) so they never overlap.\n- **Note on Mobile Label Alignment**: Check in the browser verification step at `390x844` whether the top pin labels `n\342\202\201 1.000` / `n\342\202\202 1.517` near `0%` or `100%` clip against the left/right edges of the middle track (`translateX(-50%)` at `left: 0%` extends left by half its width!). If `n1 = 1.000` (`0%`) clips or touches the left column on narrow screens, clamp/adjust label alignment or transform (e.g., use `left: 0%` -> `translateX(0%)`, `left >= 88%` -> `translateX(-100%)`, else `translateX(-50%)`) \342\200\224 consider fixing that proactively or inspecting closely during browser verification!\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **No errors encountered yet on this task.**\n- **Previous Session Resolved Issues (for reference)**:\n  - Fixed mobile 3D bottom dock button clipping in `WaveScene3D.tsx` (`flex-wrap`, shortened 4th preset to `C\341\272\255n c\341\272\243nh`).\n  - Added strict `{ exact: true }` in Playwright button locators when multiple buttons share partial Vietnamese substrings.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Express + Vite dev server is running on port 3000 with the previous build (before adding `RefractiveIndexComparisonChart`).\n- No background tasks or Chromium sessions are open.\n- Both `/src/utils/refractiveComparison.ts` and `/src/components/RefractiveIndexComparisonChart.tsx` are saved on disk and ready to be wired into `/src/App.tsx`.\n\n## 6. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\n1. **Proactive Edge-Alignment Polish on `/src/components/RefractiveIndexComparisonChart.tsx`** *(quick improvement before first compile)*:\n   - For the floating `n\342\202\201` and `n\342\202\202` pin labels above the scale track, when `pct < 12` use `translateX(0%)` (left-aligned to the tick) and when `pct > 88` use `translateX(-100%)` (right-aligned to the tick), else `translateX(-50%)` \342\200\224 this guarantees `n\342\202\201 = 1.000` (at `0%`) and `n\342\202\202 = 3.420` (near `97%`) NEVER bleed into the left material-name column or right numeric column!\n2. **Wire `<RefractiveIndexComparisonChart />` into `/src/App.tsx`**:\n   - Import `RefractiveIndexComparisonChart` from `./components/RefractiveIndexComparisonChart`.\n   - Render it right below `<FresnelChart ... />` inside `activeTab === \'SIMULATOR\'`, wiring:\n     - `n1`, `n2`, `material1Id`, `material2Id`, `material1Label`, `material2Label`\n     - `onSelectMaterialForN1={(mat) => { setActiveScenarioId(null); setMaterial1Id(mat.id); setN1(mat.refractiveIndex); }}`\n     - `onSelectMaterialForN2={(mat) => { setActiveScenarioId(null); setMaterial2Id(mat.id); setN2(mat.refractiveIndex); }}`\n3. **Add Unit Tests in `/src/physics/emPhysics.test.ts`**:\n   - Add test covering `buildRefractiveComparisonModel`, `filterMaterialsByGroup`, and `findMaterialBracket`:\n     - Default Air (`1.0003`) -> BK7 (`1.517`) highlights `air` as `isCurrentN1` and `bk7` as `isCurrentN2`, `ratioN2ToN1 \342\211\210 1.5165`, `deltaN > 0`.\n     - Custom `n2 = 2.05` identifies `lowerNeighbor = flint (1.785)` and `upperNeighbor = diamond (2.417)` with `exactMatch = null`.\n     - Custom `n2 = 3.8` expands `maxScale > 3.8` so `n2Pct <= 100`.\n     - `filterMaterialsByGroup` with `\'OPTICAL\'` returns only `\'Th\341\273\247y tinh & Quang h\341\273\215c\'` items.\n4. **Build, Lint & Unit Test**:\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, and `npx --yes tsx --test src/physics/emPhysics.test.ts` (all 15 tests must pass).\n5. **Restart Dev Server & Run 1 Targeted Browser Verification Round (`playwright-cli` with `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`)**:\n   - **Desktop `1440x900`**:\n     - Scroll to `[data-testid=\"refractive-comparison-chart\"]` -> verify bars, `n\342\202\201`/`n\342\202\202` reference lines, and bracket summary -> screenshot `.playwright-cli/r11-comparison-desktop.png`.\n     - Test interactive journeys:\n       1. Type custom `2.050` in `#m2-number-input` -> verify `[data-testid=\"comparison-bracket-summary\"]` updates to show between `K\303\255nh Flint (SF11)` and `Kim c\306\260\306\241ng (C)`.\n       2. Click category filter `Quang h\341\273\215c` -> verify row count reduces; click `T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243`; click `[data-testid=\"comparison-bar-diamond\"]` -> verify `#m2-number-input` and `[data-testid=\"chart-marker-n2\"]` update immediately to `2.417` -> screenshot `.playwright-cli/r11-comparison-diamond.png`.\n   - **Mobile `390x844`**:\n     - Scroll to `[data-testid=\"refractive-comparison-chart\"]` -> check `document.documentElement.scrollWidth <= window.innerWidth` and inspect layout -> screenshot `.playwright-cli/r11-comparison-mobile.png`.\n   - Check `playwright-cli console` for `0 Errors, 0 Warnings`.\n   - Inspect all captured screenshots; if any layout defect appears, fix it and re-verify (compile + lint + tests + restart + capture).\n6. **Final Response**:\n   - Concise 2\342\200\2233 plain-language Vietnamese sentences confirming the interactive refractive index comparison chart is live below the Fresnel chart in `M\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng 2D`, highlighting its live `n\342\202\201`/`n\342\202\202` markers, optical contrast band, category filters, custom-value bracket comparison, and one-click material assignment. No code snippets, file paths, or internal jargon.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Language**: 100% Vietnamese UI copy and Vietnamese final response.\n- **Typography**: Preserve `Be Vietnam Pro` (`font-display`), `IBM Plex Sans` (`font-sans`), and `JetBrains Mono` (`font-mono tabular-nums`).\n- **Design Discipline**: Zero static pill capsules on metadata, no thick left accent borders (`border-l-4`), no decorative pulsing dots, single-line controls (`whitespace-nowrap`), accessible native `<button>` elements.\n- **Verification Discipline**: Run `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, `npx --yes tsx --test src/physics/emPhysics.test.ts`, `restart_dev_server`, and browser inspection AFTER the final code edit. Always close `playwright-cli` via `trap`.\n</summary>"
