  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Automated Testing**\n\nI\'m now integrating Playwright into a clean script to verify the browser functionality. The current focus is on desktop resolution `1440x900`. I\'m using `run-code` with `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`. I plan to scroll the `[data-testid=\"refractive-comparison-chart\"]` into view and capture a `.playwright` screenshot.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "grAHa5GyC6GN28oP8Iai6AU"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_11696148359582848396"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\nmkdir -p .playwright-cli && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000 && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \'async (page) => {\\n    const chart = page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"refractive-comparison-chart\\\\\\\"]\\\");\\n    await chart.waitFor({ state: \\\"visible\\\", timeout: 10000 });\\n    await chart.scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(450);\\n    await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/r11-comparison-desktop.png\\\" });\\n\\n    // Journey 1: Enter custom n2 = 2.050 and check bracket insight\\n    const m2Input = page.locator(\\\"#m2-number-input\\\");\\n    await m2Input.fill(\\\"2.050\\\");\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(350);\\n    const bracketText = await page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"comparison-bracket-summary\\\\\\\"]\\\").textContent();\\n    const n2MarkerCustom = await page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"chart-marker-n2\\\\\\\"]\\\").textContent();\\n\\n    // Journey 2: Filter category to Quang h\341\273\215c, verify count drops, then switch back to T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243 and click Diamond\\n    const countAll = await chart.locator(\\\"button[data-testid^=\\\\\\\"comparison-bar-\\\\\\\"]\\\").count();\\n    await chart.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: \\\"Quang h\341\273\215c\\\", exact: true }).click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(200);\\n    const countOptical = await chart.locator(\\\"button[data-testid^=\\\\\\\"comparison-bar-\\\\\\\"]\\\").count();\\n    await chart.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: \\\"T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243\\\", exact: true }).click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(200);\\n\\n    await chart.locator(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"comparison-bar-diamond\\\\\\\"]\\\").click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(450);\\n    const n2MarkerDiamond = await page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"chart-marker-n2\\\\\\\"]\\\").textContent();\\n    const m2ValueAfterClick = await m2Input.inputValue();\\n    await chart.scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(250);\\n    await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/r11-comparison-diamond.png\\\" });\\n\\n    // Mobile 390x844 verification\\n    await page.setViewportSize({ width: 390, height: 844 });\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(350);\\n    const mobileOverflow = await page.evaluate(() => ({\\n      scrollWidth: document.documentElement.scrollWidth,\\n      innerWidth: window.innerWidth,\\n      hasOverflow: document.documentElement.scrollWidth > window.innerWidth\\n    }));\\n    await chart.scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(300);\\n    await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/r11-comparison-mobile.png\\\" });\\n\\n    return JSON.stringify({\\n      bracketText,\\n      n2MarkerCustom,\\n      countAll,\\n      countOptical,\\n      n2MarkerDiamond,\\n      m2ValueAfterClick,\\n      mobileOverflow\\n    }, null, 2);\\n  }\' && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli console\",\"Cwd\":\".\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000,\"toolAction\":\"Verifying comparison chart in Chromium across desktop and mobile\",\"toolSummary\":\"Browser verification of comparison chart\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\325\f\n\322\f\001i\024}\023\204\034\nl\a\306O<\f\001\246\361\225th\226b\377\231\027>\354\336\244$6\353\005I\301w\\\bT\206\331\334\246\033\343/\3107\370P \345pF\325\340\020\332e\306\3703k\231b\227:\304,sZ\2633\334\365/\257\177\357i\235|\207\243\325\272\024\334P\0322;\247\003\v)Z\026Qd0Z\357\021\347S\003\275i\267#[\354:(\037\220n:\306ko\027\004C\310R\255\2335\2515\b\022\337>\020\331{c\321\350\001\246\224?\203\222\321\023\344\254\356\316\375\215\026\215\262\330y2\003\3504\301\370\230\261\325%m-\365\212\200%5\205\266*\254\004Q\232\224\301\030\377\027\206\363\337\312H\234\314\233\t>\342\232\343k+\006\360d\230\026\307\273\356\026P\315\321\251\002\236!O\324\373\262(\372<E\234\346\005*\227h\026\034?\352\223\363\314f\224q\373\255bnG\332\303\035\336W4<\347|XXy\221\a]\033\231\370WOBJ\003\235\v{\340V!\342dT\v\b\200\304\016\336\003\324\302\267\377\322$\233\037ev\371\030\024\204\301\001&1\226\301\2054\a\343`\320\271.P\215\027(O\250\332f\2120S\t\243p\016\333~\273:B\343\272J\000\200\rD\206r]\3124\254\223\370\350\3208R\353J?\037\337\355g<]\256D\363\343\340\303\035\037#\v\335+\362\177E\b/!\373\323~\346O?\225\210B\314\346\027\253-sa\035\220]\237\321\344\365\216P\252\021\265gJr:\265>\016z]2\360%\005\226\315\224S\303\320\362\252\365\217\317.\370\267\n\327\b\256]ms\230\314\341\3064kS`%R]\217\363\354E\220\016\r\232(\256_0\377+{\315\206L\201\366\2611\212\254\327\373{\354\354\266\264f\205F\244\265I\257\364\321\2752\371\331\036\246/\261 y\210:\324\304\271\237B\211\2430v\317\322\235_\251\034}\372!y\201^\231B\227\363\347\342\277d\331]\307\266\377\004\340hu\214\222U.r?j\376 E]\241\250&\251\361\226\035\261\370\227\234+\361\343b\315\315*hL\022\216Kr8\203\033\036\255\313\314\223\250N\342l}\312rpN\347\335?\303\342u\334\027W\227\223r&a\277f>\257\233\033\346\216E\343\003\244ys\322#\250\213\356\004\321 \031\000\222\023\002\257\005\207kj\"\344\355~\252\374\245w\370\261\304\262\212\271\002oy\351P\023\t\257\250\030)\2256~\226\307\2410\177PKr`\336\325\317QK(\277\001g\336\33