  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Timeout Root Cause**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed the root cause of the `page.screenshot()` timeout. The 2D `WaveCanvas` contains a persistent `requestAnimationFrame` loop, and concurrent `motion/react` spring animations were also running. This created a scenario where Playwright\'s screenshot functionality was indefinitely waiting for animation stabilization or encountered a busy compositor.\n\n\n**Refining Presentation Details**\n\nI have a plan to address the copy polish! The accessibility snapshot confirmed a subtle presentation issue in the Vietnamese text; the `formatBracketDescription` helper can be refactored to avoid redundant phrases when the context matches. The refactor involves cleaner handling of the exact match scenario, avoiding repetition for improved clarity, making sure the presentation is top-notch!\n\n\n"
    message_id: "JrEHa8LUKp25kdUP9OTu0AI"
