  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visuals Critically**\n\nI\'m diving deep into the screenshots now, and the initial desktop views are striking. I\'m focusing on the typography and vertical alignment; it\'s quite clean. I\'ll need to dissect these pixel by pixel to fully appreciate the design choices. I\'m noting the n\342\202\201/n\342\202\202 alignment now.\n\n\n**Pinpointing Discrepancies Visually**\n\nI\'ve homed in on specific visual discrepancies now. The alignment of the \"Kim c\306\260\306\241ng (C)\" bar relative to the `n\342\202\202` reference line is off, and it\'s visible on both desktop and mobile views. The issue likely stems from the `<button>` element\'s padding and margins within `RefractiveIndexComparisonChart.tsx`. Specifically, `px-1 -mx-1` combined with `w-full` creates a visual shift of the grid boundaries, misaligning the bar by roughly 4px on desktop, and 5px on mobile, compared to the expected alignment with the indigo line.\n\n\n**Fixing Pixel-Perfect Alignment**\n\nI\'ve made a crucial discovery. The indigo line and tick positioning, specifically on mobile, are off. The even distribution from `flex justify-between` on the axis ticks is a key issue. I am seeing that the initial misalignment of `Kim c\306\260\306\241ng (C)` stems from `<button>`\'s padding/margins. Removing `-mx-1 px-1` on the buttons, or applying uniform padding across related elements, resolves this, ensuring pixel-perfect alignment.\n\n\n**Refining Tick Positioning**\n\nI\'ve been wrestling with those axis ticks. Currently, they\'re misaligned due to `flex justify-between`, leading them to be spaced at fixed percentages. I\'m experimenting with absolute positioning and the `translateX` transform to align each tick mathematically, which should produce perfect alignment. Now, I have to ensure that each `<span>` is positioned precisely above its vertical gridline across both desktop and mobile. I\'m also examining the JSON output for custom values, especially the `bracketText`, so that I can prevent unintentional duplication.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "orIHa6PDENCEkdUPjMup0Q4"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4564420021749449672"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Fix pixel-exact bar-to-reference-line alignment, mathematically positioned axis ticks, custom label deduplication, and mobile toggle label clarity\",\"Instruction\":\"Deduplicate (n = ...) in formatBracketDescription, show concise mobile label for n1/n2 target selector, position axis ticks by true mathematical percentage, and remove asymmetric px-1 -mx-1 offset on row buttons so bar ends meet vertical reference lines pixel-for-pixel\",\"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":47,\"ReplacementContent\":\"function formatBracketDescription(\\n  mediumLabel: string,\\n  n: number,\\n  bracket: MaterialBracketSummary\\n): string {\\n  const formattedLabel = mediumLabel.includes(\'(n =\')\\n    ? mediumLabel\\n    : `${mediumLabel} (n = ${n.toFixed(3)})`;\\n\\n  if (bracket.exactMatch) {\\n    if (bracket.exactMatch.name === mediumLabel) {\\n      return `Kh\341\273\233p chu\341\272\251n th\306\260 vi\341\273\207n: ${bracket.exactMatch.name} (n = ${n.toFixed(3)}).`;\\n    }\\n    return `${formattedLabel} kh\341\273\233p chu\341\272\251n v\341\273\233i ${bracket.exactMatch.name}.`;\\n  }\\n  if (bracket.lowerNeighbor && bracket.upperNeighbor) {\\n    return `${formattedLabel} n\341\272\261m gi\341\273\257a ${bracket.lowerNeighbor.name} (${bracket.lowerNeighbor.refractiveIndex.toFixed(3)}) v\303\240 ${bracket.upperNeighbor.name} (${bracket.upperNeighbor.refractiveIndex.toFixed(3)}).`;\\n  }\\n  if (bracket.lowerNeighbor) {\\n    return `${formattedLabel} cao h\306\241n v\341\272\255t li\341\273\207u cao nh\341\272\245t trong th\306\260 vi\341\273\207n l\303\240 ${bracket.lowerNeighbor.name} (${bracket.lowerNeighbor.refractiveIndex.toFixed(3)}).`;\\n  }\\n  return `${formattedLabel} g\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t v\341\273\233i ${bracket.nearest.name} (${bracket.nearest.refractiveIndex.toFixed(3)}).`;\\n}\",\"StartLine\":28,\"TargetContent\":\"function formatBracketDescription(\\n  mediumLabel: string,\\n  n: number,\\n  bracket: MaterialBracketSummary\\n): string {\\n  if (bracket.exactMatch) {\\n    if (bracket.exactMatch.name === mediumLabel) {\\n      return `Kh\341\273\233p chu\341\272\251n th\306\260 vi\341\273\207n: ${bracket.exactMatch.name} (n = ${n.toFixed(3)}).`;\\n    }\\n    return `${mediumLabel} (n = ${n.toFixed(3)}) kh\341\273\233p chu\341\272\251n v\341\273\233i ${bracket.exactMatch.name}.`;\\n  }\\n  if (bracket.lowerNeighbor && bracket.upperNeighbor) {\\n    return `${mediumLabel} (n = ${n.toFixed(3)}) n\341\272\261m gi\341\273\257a ${bracket.lowerNeighbor.name} (${bracket.lowerNeighbor.refractiveIndex.toFixed(3)}) v\303\240 ${bracket.upperNeighbor.name} (${bracket.upperNeighbor.refractiveIndex.toFixed(3)}).`;\\n  }\\n  if (bracket.lowerNeighbor) {\\n    return `${mediumLabel} (n = ${n.toFixed(3)}) cao h\306\241n v\341\272\255t li\341\273\207u cao nh\341\272\245t trong th\306\260 vi\341\273\207n l\303\240 ${bracket.lowerNeighbor.name} (${bracket.lowerNeighbor.refractiveIndex.toFixed(3)}).`;\\n  }\\n  return `${mediumLabel} (n = ${n.toFixed(3)}) g\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t v\341\273\233i ${bracket.nearest.name} (${bracket.nearest.refractiveIndex.toFixed(3)}).`;\\n}\"},{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":230,\"ReplacementContent\":\"            <span className=\\\"pl-2 pr-1 text-xs text-slate-500 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"sm:hidden\\\">G\303\241n:</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">Nh\341\272\245p \304\221\341\273\203 g\303\241n:</span>\\n            </span>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              aria-pressed={assignTarget === \'N1\'}\\n              onClick={() => setAssignTarget(\'N1\')}\\n              className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer ${\\n                assignTarget === \'N1\'\\n                  ? \'bg-sky-700 text-white shadow-xs\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              n\342\202\201\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              aria-pressed={assignTarget === \'N2\'}\\n              onClick={() => setAssignTarget(\'N2\')}\\n              className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer ${\\n                assignTarget === \'N2\'\\n                  ? \'bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-xs\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              n\342\202\202\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Calibrated Horizontal Bar Chart with Full-Height n1 & n2 Reference Overlay */}\\n      <div className=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n        {/* Top Reference Callout & Scale Axis Header */}\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-[118px_minmax(0,1fr)_52px] sm:grid-cols-[210px_minmax(0,1fr)_104px] gap-2 sm:gap-3 items-end\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 pb-1\\\">V\341\272\255t li\341\273\207u chu\341\272\251n</div>\\n\\n          {/* Scale Track Header + Floating n1/n2 Pin Labels */}\\n          <div className=\\\"relative h-14 sm:h-11\\\">\\n            {/* n1 marker label */}\\n            <motion.div\\n              data-testid=\\\"chart-marker-n1\\\"\\n              animate={{ left: `${model.n1Pct}%` }}\\n              transition={transition}\\n              style={{ transform: getMarkerHorizontalShift(model.n1Pct) }}\\n              className={`absolute ${\\n                model.markersAreClose ? \'top-0\' : \'top-0 sm:top-0.5\'\\n              } font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-800 whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums select-none`}\\n            >\\n              n\342\202\201 {n1.toFixed(3)}\\n            </motion.div>\\n\\n            {/* n2 marker label (staggered vertically on narrow screens or when close to n1) */}\\n            <motion.div\\n              data-testid=\\\"chart-marker-n2\\\"\\n              animate={{ left: `${model.n2Pct}%` }}\\n              transition={transition}\\n              style={{ transform: getMarkerHorizontalShift(model.n2Pct) }}\\n              className={`absolute ${\\n                model.markersAreClose ? \'top-4\' : \'top-4 sm:top-0.5\'\\n              } font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-indigo-700 whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums select-none`}\\n            >\\n              n\342\202\202 {n2.toFixed(3)}\\n            </motion.div>\\n\\n            {/* Calibrated numeric axis ticks positioned strictly at true mathematical percentages */}\\n            <div className=\\\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-4 border-b border-slate-200 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 tabular-nums\\\">\\n              {model.ticks.map((tick, idx) => {\\n                const pct =\\n                  ((tick - model.minScale) / (model.maxScale - model.minScale)) * 100;\\n                const isFirst = idx === 0;\\n                const isLast = idx === model.ticks.length - 1;\\n                const showOnMobile = isFirst || isLast || idx % 2 === 0;\\n                const shift = isFirst\\n                  ? \'translateX(0%)\'\\n                  : isLast\\n                  ? \'translateX(-100%)\'\\n                  : \'translateX(-50%)\';\\n                return (\\n                  <span\\n                    key={tick}\\n                    style={{ left: `${pct}%`, transform: shift }}\\n                    className={`absolute bottom-0.5 leading-none ${\\n                      showOnMobile ? \'inline\' : \'hidden sm:inline\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    {tick.toFixed(1)}\\n                  </span>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 text-right pb-1\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"sm:hidden\\\">n</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">n / \316\265r</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\",\"StartLine\":140,\"TargetContent\":\"            <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline pl-2 pr-1 text-xs text-slate-500 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n              Nh\341\272\245p \304\221\341\273\203 g\303\241n:\\n            </span>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              aria-pressed={assignTarget === \'N1\'}\\n              onClick={() => setAssignTarget(\'N1\')}\\n              className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer ${\\n                assignTarget === \'N1\'\\n                  ? \'bg-sky-700 text-white shadow-xs\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              n\342\202\201\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              aria-pressed={assignTarget === \'N2\'}\\n              onClick={() => setAssignTarget(\'N2\')}\\n              className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer ${\\n                assignTarget === \'N2\'\\n                  ? \'bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-xs\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              n\342\202\202\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Calibrated Horizontal Bar Chart with Full-Height n1 & n2 Reference Overlay */}\\n      <div className=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n        {/* Top Reference Callout & Scale Axis Header */}\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-[118px_minmax(0,1fr)_52px] sm:grid-cols-[210px_minmax(0,1fr)_104px] gap-2 sm:gap-3 items-end\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 pb-1\\\">V\341\272\255t li\341\273\207u chu\341\272\251n</div>\\n\\n          {/* Scale Track Header + Floating n1/n2 Pin Labels */}\\n          <div className=\\\"relative h-12 sm:h-11\\\">\\n            {/* n1 marker label */}\\n            <motion.div\\n              data-testid=\\\"chart-marker-n1\\\"\\n              animate={{ left: `${model.n1Pct}%` }}\\n              transition={transition}\\n              style={{ transform: getMarkerHorizontalShift(model.n1Pct) }}\\n              className={`absolute ${\\n                model.markersAreClose ? \'top-0\' : \'top-0 sm:top-1\'\\n              } font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-800 whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums select-none`}\\n            >\\n              n\342\202\201 {n1.toFixed(3)}\\n            </motion.div>\\n\\n            {/* n2 marker label (staggered vertically on narrow screens or when close to n1) */}\\n            <motion.div\\n              data-testid=\\\"chart-marker-n2\\\"\\n              animate={{ left: `${model.n2Pct}%` }}\\n              transition={transition}\\n              style={{ transform: getMarkerHorizontalShift(model.n2Pct) }}\\n              className={`absolute ${\\n                model.markersAreClose ? \'top-4\' : \'top-4 sm:top-1\'\\n              } font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-indigo-700 whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums select-none`}\\n            >\\n              n\342\202\202 {n2.toFixed(3)}\\n            </motion.div>\\n\\n            {/* Calibrated numeric axis ticks along bottom of header */}\\n            <div className=\\\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 tabular-nums border-b border-slate-200 pb-0.5\\\">\\n              {model.ticks.map((tick, idx) => {\\n                const showOnMobile =\\n                  idx === 0 || idx === model.ticks.length - 1 || idx % 2 === 0;\\n                return (\\n                  <span\\n                    key={tick}\\n                    className={showOnMobile ? \'inline\' : \'hidden sm:inline\'}\\n                  >\\n                    {tick.toFixed(1)}\\n                  </span>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 text-right pb-1\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"sm:hidden\\\">n</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">n / \316\265r</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\"},{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":326,\"ReplacementContent\":\"                  className={`group w-full text-left grid grid-cols-[118px_minmax(0,1fr)_52px] sm:grid-cols-[210px_minmax(0,1fr)_104px] gap-2 sm:gap-3 items-center py-2 rounded-md transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n                    isMatched ? \'bg-slate-50/80\' : \'hover:bg-slate-50/70\'\\n                  }`}\",\"StartLine\":310,\"TargetContent\":\"                  className={`group w-full text-left grid grid-cols-[118px_minmax(0,1fr)_52px] sm:grid-cols-[210px_minmax(0,1fr)_104px] gap-2 sm:gap-3 items-center py-2 px-1 -mx-1 rounded-md transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n                    isMatched ? \'bg-slate-50/80\' : \'hover:bg-slate-50/70\'\\n                  }`}\"}],\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/RefractiveIndexComparisonChart.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Fixing chart tick math, bar alignment, and custom label copy\",\"toolSummary\":\"Fix chart alignment and tick math\"}"
