              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "      \'Th\341\273\247y tinh borosilicate chu\341\272\251n quang h\341\273\215c v\341\273\233i n = 1.517, l\303\240m n\303\251n b\306\260\341\273\233c s\303\263ng xu\341\273\221ng kho\341\272\243ng 65.9% so v\341\273\233i trong ch\303\242n kh\303\264ng. \304\220\341\273\231 truy\341\273\201n qua cao v\303\240 t\303\241n s\341\272\257c th\341\272\245p (Abbe 64.2) gi\303\272p BK7 tr\341\273\237 th\303\240nh chu\341\272\251n tham chi\341\272\277u cho l\304\203ng k\303\255nh v\303\240 th\341\272\245u k\303\255nh h\341\273\231i t\341\273\245.\',"
